<section class="process-section"><div class="wrap process-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">HOW WE’LL WORK TOGETHER</p><h2>A clear path<br>from <em>idea to done.</em></h2></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Talk it through.</h3><p>Tell me what you have in mind, what you need it to do, and any budget or timing considerations.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Work out the details.</h3><p>We’ll agree on the scope, approach, and quote before the work begins.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Build, review, refine.</h3><p>I’ll work directly with you through the project and explain what you need to know along the way.</p></div></li></ol></div></section>
